Error [E0712]: This `#FX` region uses the effect `FS.Read`, which it has no authority for
  --> tests/ui/crypto_expert_nonce_region_authority_precedence.jet:6:8
    |
  6 |     #FX(Net) {
    |        ^^^^^
 Why: `#FX(…)` allows only `Net`; an effect reached inside — even through a call — must be in that list
 Fix: Add `FS.Read` to the `#FX(…)` list, or move that work outside the region
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: #FX
 Scope chain: #FX
